BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d-irish-jam-20261107@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261113T194845Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T170000
SUMMARY:Irish Music Jam at Moon Dog Meadery
LOCATION:Moon Dog Meadery & Bottle Shop (basement under Joe Van Gogh)\, 110
 4 Broad St\, Suite C\, Durham\, NC 27705
DESCRIPTION:Open Irish/Celtic tune jam twice a month at a community-minded 
 meadery\; players and listeners welcome. Twice-monthly rhythm means you se
 e the same musicians quickly.\n\n1st and 3rd Saturdays\n\nHow to join: Jus
 t show up with an instrument (or to listen)\n\nBefore you go: Check around
  holidays\, especially Jan 2.\n\nhttps://www.moondogmeadery.com/events\n\n
 Listed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.moondogmeadery.com/events
END:VEVENT
