BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d-open-mic-20261108@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261113T194845Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T210000
SUMMARY:Moon Dog Sunday Open Mic
LOCATION:Moon Dog Meadery & Bottle Shop\, 1104 Broad St\, Suite C\, Durham\
 , NC 27705
DESCRIPTION:Weekly open mic hosted by Deb Aronin: music\, comedy\, poetry\,
  anything goes in a judgment-free\, dog-friendly room. Perform or just com
 e listen\; lots of repeat regulars.\n\nSign-up 6:30pm\, performances start
  7pm\n\nHow to join: Just show up\; register at 6:30pm to perform\n\nBefor
 e you go: Confirm holiday Sundays (Dec 27).\n\nhttps://www.moondogmeadery.
 com/events\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.moondogmeadery.com/events
END:VEVENT
