SUMMARY:Trivia with Arturo at Fullsteam (American Tobacco Campus)
LOCATION:Fullsteam Public House\, American Tobacco Campus\, 320 Blackwell S
 t\, Suite 100\, Durham\, NC 27701
DESCRIPTION:Pub trivia every Thursday\, hosted by Arturo\, in the Public Ho
 use at Fullsteam's American Tobacco Campus location downtown. New and retu
 rning players are both welcome\, and a quiz gives a table plenty to talk a
 bout.\n\nFour rounds\n\nHow to join: Show up before 7:30pm and get a table
  in the Public House. Extra seating opens when there's room.\n\nBefore you
  go: Nov 26 is Thanksgiving. Check Fullsteam's calendar to confirm that we
 ek's trivia.\n\nhttps://www.fullsteam.ag/event/trivia-with-arturo/2026-11-
 19\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.fullsteam.ag/event/trivia-with-arturo/2026-11-19
