DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T213000
SUMMARY:Mettlesome Free Improv Jam
LOCATION:Mettlesome (Golden Belt)\, 800 Taylor St\, Suite 9-156\, Durham\, 
 NC 27701
DESCRIPTION:Free weekly improv jam: names go in a bucket and everyone gets 
 on stage\; beginner-friendly on-ramp to Mettlesome's community.\n\nHarold 
 Night show ($8) at 7:30 just before\n\nHow to join: Just show up. Improv 1
