SUMMARY:Stonewall Run Club
LOCATION:Wolfe & Porter\, 905 W Morgan St\, Raleigh\, NC 27603
DESCRIPTION:Inclusive social run club for all levels\, explicitly pitched a
 s a way to exercise and meet people. The bar's Tuesday trivia starts right
  after.\n\n1-5 mile routes\, then drinks and socializing\n\nHow to join: A
 rrive 5-10 minutes early to sign a waiver on your phone\; ask for the dire
 ctors\, Aaron or Tyler\n\nBefore you go: Dates are posted through Dec 31\,
  2026. The club meets at Wolfe & Porter\; some older coverage lists other 
 bars.\n\nhttps://www.visitraleigh.com/event/stonewall-run-club-meet-up/104
 057/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.visitraleigh.com/event/stonewall-run-club-meet-up/104057/
