UID:r-taco-tuesday-ride-20261110@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261113T194845Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T200000
SUMMARY:Raleigh Brewing Taco Tuesday Bike Ride
LOCATION:Raleigh Brewing Company\, 3709 Neil St\, Raleigh\, NC 27607
DESCRIPTION:Weekly group road ride in three pace groups\, then tacos and be
 er at the brewery.\n\nCheck-in and rollout at 6pm. Pace groups: A about 20
  mph\, B social 13-15 mph\, C beginner-friendly 12-13 mph.\n\nHow to join:
  Just show up\; RSVP on Meetup is optional\n\nBefore you go: The next ride
  is listed for Nov 17. Confirm it continues in winter darkness and whether
  lights are required.\n\nhttps://www.meetup.com/raleigh-brewing-walk-cycle
 -run-trivia-fun/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.meetup.com/raleigh-brewing-walk-cycle-run-trivia-fun/
END:VEVENT
