DTSTAMP:20261113T194845Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261122
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
SUMMARY:Raleigh Rescue Mission holiday meal packing & delivery
LOCATION:Christ the King Presbyterian Church (packing and distribution site
 )\, 1417 Clifton St\, Raleigh\, NC 27604
DESCRIPTION:Pack and deliver holiday meals in teams. Unlike onsite shifts a
 t the Mission\, no training is required.\n\nThanksgiving: packing Sun Nov 
 22 and Nov 23-25\, delivery Thu Nov 26. Christmas: packing Dec 21-22\, del
 ivery Dec 23. Shift times are on SignUpGenius.\n\nHow to join: SignUpGeniu
 s: signupgenius.com/go/20F0E4FAEA829A0FF2-65730604-2026 for Thanksgiving\,
  signupgenius.com/go/20F0E4FAEA829A0FF2-65731134-2026 for Christmas\n\nBef
 ore you go: Regular onsite volunteering at the Mission (314 E Hargett St) 
 requires orientation and is for ages 16+.\n\nhttps://www.raleighrescue.org
 /volunteer\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.raleighrescue.org/volunteer
END:VEVENT
