SUMMARY:Silent Book Club at Oberlin Regional Library
LOCATION:Oberlin Regional Library (Wake County Public Libraries)\, 1930 Cla
 rk Ave\, Raleigh\, NC 27605
DESCRIPTION:Official Silent Book Club chapter: bring any book. The intro ro
 und gives a low-pressure way to meet other readers.\n\nOptional round of i
 ntroductions sharing what you're reading\, then quiet reading\n\nHow to jo
 in: Register through the Eventbrite link on the Wake County event page\n\n
 Before you go: Dec 3 is confirmed. The club may skip Jan 7 and restart in 
 February.\n\nhttps://www.wake.gov/events/silent-book-club-oberlin-regional
 -library-19\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.wake.gov/events/silent-book-club-oberlin-regional-library-1
 9
