DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T160000
SUMMARY:Intro to Cross Stitch workshop
LOCATION:Pullen Arts Center\, 105 Pullen Rd\, Raleigh\, NC 27607
DESCRIPTION:A small one-afternoon workshop at the city's arts center where 
 you learn cross stitch alongside other beginners.\n\nHow to join: Register
  through the City's WebTrac link on Pullen's Take a Class page\, or call 9
 19-996-6126\n\nBefore you go: Winter 2027 multi-week classes aren't posted
  yet. Registration for last year's winter classes opened in late November.
 \n\nhttps://raleighnc.gov/arts/take-class-pullen-arts-center\n\nListed on 
 Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://raleighnc.gov/arts/take-class-pullen-arts-center
END:VEVENT
