DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T203000
SUMMARY:One Day Clay: Cozy Winter Critters
LOCATION:Claymakers (Sculpture & Handbuilding Studio)\, 470 Salem St\, Durh
 am\, NC 27703
DESCRIPTION:Hand-sculpt a small winter animal\, such as a penguin\, bear or
  fox. It's a relaxed evening at Durham's community clay studio\, working s
 ide by side with other beginners.\n\nFriday 6:30–8:30pm\, one 2-hour cla
 ss. Ages 18+. Only 2 spots were left on Nov 13.\n\nHow to join: Register o
 n the class page at claymakers.org. Questions: (919) 530-8355.\n\nBefore y
 ou go: The page doesn't show the year\, but the weekday matches 2026. Near
 ly sold out.\n\nhttps://claymakers.org/classes/p/pb39f54orcti6u70ktsh7fogk
 q9txw\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://claymakers.org/classes/p/pb39f54orcti6u70ktsh7fogkq9txw
END:VEVENT
