DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T203000
SUMMARY:One Day Clay: Winter Candleholders
LOCATION:Claymakers (Sculpture & Handbuilding Studio)\, 470 Salem St\, Durh
 am\, NC 27703
DESCRIPTION:Start with a pinch pot and turn it into a winter-scene votive h
 older with textures\, seasonal decorations and small critters. It's a begi
 nner-friendly group class\, good for a solo night out or with a friend.\n\
 nSaturday 6:30–8:30pm\, one 2-hour class. Ages 18+.\n\nHow to join: Regi
 ster on the class page at claymakers.org. Questions: (919) 530-8355.\n\nBe
 fore you go: The class list shows it open but gives no spot count\, and th
 e class page also has a waitlist form. Confirm availability.\n\nhttps://cl
 aymakers.org/classes/p/one-day-clay-winter-scene-candleholders-saturday-no
 vember-21\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://claymakers.org/classes/p/one-day-clay-winter-scene-candleholder
 s-saturday-november-21
END:VEVENT
